# Scope: header-footer-code plugin only

- **Only modify files under this repository root** (`user/plugins/header-footer-code/`).
- Do **not** edit `user/config/`, `user/pages/`, themes, other plugins, `system/`, `vendor/`, or parent Grav site `.cursor/`.
- If plugin enablement or site config is needed, **describe steps for the user**; do not apply them from this workspace.

Examples:

```
✅ header-footer-code.php
✅ admin-next/pages/header-footer-code.js
✅ blueprints.yaml
✅ classes/SnippetRepository.php

❌ user/config/plugins/header-footer-code.yaml
❌ user/data/header-footer-code/snippets.yaml
❌ user/themes/thepractice-accrete/
❌ parent Grav .cursor/notes/changelog.md
```
